WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.667
-So, I was sitting
on this flight,

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:07.334
and everybody that walked on
kept saying to the woman

00:00:07.334 --> 00:00:09.234
next to me, "Oh, my gosh.

00:00:09.234 --> 00:00:13.300
I'd know that face from anywhere
or even with a mask on.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.601
Look at you.
I know that hair."

00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:17.567
And I was like,
"Who the hell is this?"

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:19.300
[ Laughter ]
And, of course,

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.801
she had a mask on,
and so I snuck a picture

00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:25.267
and sent it to my wife,
and I was like, "Who is this?"

00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:26.968
And then, she didn't know.
And then we sent it

00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:30.000
to everyone else that was
celebrity-obsessed.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.300
Nobody knows who this person is.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.667
-And you didn't
want to ask the person.

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:35.534
You're not --
-Well, no, halfway through

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:37.868
the flight,
there was a spider on her leg,

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:39.334
and, uh...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:43.934
And I said, "Oh, excuse me.
You have a spider on your leg."

00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:46.234
And she said, "Oh, my gosh.
Thank you."

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:47.901
And she brushed it off.

00:00:47.901 --> 00:00:49.934
And I was like,
"I don't know that voice."

00:00:49.934 --> 00:00:52.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:53.400
"Who is this person?"
-All right.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.968
So you brought the photo.
-Yeah.

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:57.467
-And this is the person
that was sitting next to you.

00:00:57.467 --> 00:01:01.667
And do we know who this?
-Who is that?

00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:05.567
Please, call 1-800...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:08.868
-Let me see this here.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:13.234
-And whoever she is,
please don't be upset with me.

00:01:13.234 --> 00:01:15.667
-She has red hair.
-And a widow's peak.

00:01:15.667 --> 00:01:17.901
-Is it Debra Messing?
-No.

00:01:17.901 --> 00:01:20.033
I feel like Deborah and I
would --

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:22.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:26.434
Let me look at this.
-Yeah.

00:01:26.434 --> 00:01:27.868
I have no clue.
Jenna Fischer?

00:01:27.868 --> 00:01:30.234
-It's America's sweetheart.
-What?

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:32.234
No, no, no, it's not.
-No, no.

00:01:32.234 --> 00:01:34.100
-No, it's not Jenna Fischer.
-She's very pretty.

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.834
Very pretty.
She looks like she's married.

00:01:35.834 --> 00:01:37.467
That's a wedding ring.
-Yeah.

00:01:37.467 --> 00:01:40.000
-So she's married.
-She carries a yellow bag.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.567
-A yellow bag.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:44.868
Oh, Tig Notaro.
Tig, hey!

00:01:44.868 --> 00:01:46.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:49.634
♪♪

00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:51.834
[ Laughs ]
How -- Can I help you?

00:01:51.834 --> 00:01:53.434
Oh, my goodness.
-Oh, that's okay.

00:01:53.434 --> 00:01:57.033
I, um -- I was just
headed off to the airport.

00:01:57.033 --> 00:01:58.167
Do you mind if I sit down?

00:01:58.167 --> 00:01:59.701
-No, please.
No, absolutely, yeah.

00:01:59.701 --> 00:02:01.601
Tig Notaro, everybody.
This is --

00:02:01.601 --> 00:02:02.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:02.868 --> 00:02:04.501
You're off to the airport.
-Yeah.

00:02:04.501 --> 00:02:06.067
-And you were just here
last night on our show.

00:02:06.067 --> 00:02:08.033
-Yeah. And it's also
"America's sweetheart"

00:02:08.033 --> 00:02:09.133
Tig Notaro.
-That's right.

00:02:09.133 --> 00:02:11.200
I forgot to mention that.
I didn't know.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:13.567
[ Both laugh ]
I forgot, America's sweetheart.

00:02:13.567 --> 00:02:15.367
-Yeah, that's right.
-What's up, buddy?

00:02:15.367 --> 00:02:19.200
How can I help you?
-Well, last night,

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.868
when I did your show,
I had shown a picture

00:02:21.868 --> 00:02:25.300
of an actress --
or, just a celebrity.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.267
I didn't know who it was
sitting next to me on a flight.

00:02:27.267 --> 00:02:30.000
-That's correct.
-Do you have the picture still?

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.133
-I do, from last night.
-Yeah.

00:02:32.133 --> 00:02:34.200
It's right there.
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:35.801
-This is the photo, yeah.
-Yeah.

00:02:35.801 --> 00:02:37.534
-We were trying to guess
who the celebrity was.

00:02:37.534 --> 00:02:39.467
-We didn't know who it was.
-No, people were coming up

00:02:39.467 --> 00:02:41.567
to her the whole flight
and saying, "I love your work."

00:02:41.567 --> 00:02:43.534
-Yeah, they were like,
"Oh, even with a mask,

00:02:43.534 --> 00:02:45.434
I know who --"
Do you mind if I take this off?

00:02:45.434 --> 00:02:47.501
-No, it looks comfortable,
by the way.

00:02:47.501 --> 00:02:48.801
-Do you want to wear it?

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:49.868
-No.
-Okay.

00:02:49.868 --> 00:02:51.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.601 --> 00:02:54.701
But --
I'll be asleep soon.

00:02:54.701 --> 00:02:57.434
But they were like,
"Yeah, even with the mask,

00:02:57.434 --> 00:03:00.267
I know who you are
and the hair."

00:03:00.267 --> 00:03:01.634
-Yeah.
-And just the whole flight,

00:03:01.634 --> 00:03:03.501
I was like,
"Who the hell is this person?"

00:03:03.501 --> 00:03:06.534
-Yeah.
-And then you posted it online.

00:03:06.534 --> 00:03:07.801
-Yeah.
-Well, I guess you also

00:03:07.801 --> 00:03:10.434
aired your show.
Yeah.

00:03:10.434 --> 00:03:12.701
-Millions of people
watch our show, as well.

00:03:12.701 --> 00:03:15.133
-However you get
your "Tonight Show."

00:03:15.133 --> 00:03:17.300
-Yeah.
-This was online,

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:21.067
and the Internet did its work.
-Yeah, and they figured it out.

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:27.300
-Figured out who it is.
And it is Rebecca Wisocky.

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.334
-Rebecca Wisocky.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:29.334 --> 00:03:30.934
-Yeah.

00:03:30.934 --> 00:03:33.701
-She is on the show...
-Yeah. I -- Yeah.

00:03:33.701 --> 00:03:36.400
-She's on the show "Ghosts,"
on CBS.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:39.267
-Yeah, that's why I came by.
I came by --

00:03:39.267 --> 00:03:41.734
I came by --
Well, I came by on my way

00:03:41.734 --> 00:03:43.901
to the airport
to let you know that

00:03:43.901 --> 00:03:46.234
and to let everyone know

00:03:46.234 --> 00:03:49.601
that she's on "Ghosts,"
on CBS, at 9:00 p.m.

00:03:49.601 --> 00:03:52.367
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:03:52.367 --> 00:03:53.868
-Oh, good. I'm glad.
-On Thursday.

00:03:53.868 --> 00:03:55.467
-Thursday nights.
-Yeah, Thursday nights.

00:03:55.467 --> 00:03:56.868
-Tune in to CBS on Thursday.
Thanks, Tig.

00:03:56.868 --> 00:03:58.200
-Yeah.
-I appreciate this.

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:00.434
-But I have to go.
-Have a safe --

00:04:00.434 --> 00:04:02.334
Have a safe flight.

00:04:02.334 --> 00:04:03.601
Tig Notaro, everybody.

00:04:03.601 --> 00:04:05.567
Thank you for coming by
and clearing that up.

00:04:05.567 --> 00:04:07.033
[ Cheers and applause ]
I appreciate this.

00:04:07.033 --> 00:04:09.067
-America's sweetheart.
-America's sweetheart,

00:04:09.067 --> 00:04:11.400
Tig Notaro, everybody.
Thanks for checking in on us.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:13.434 --> 00:04:15.868
[ Laughs ]
Oh, my gosh.

00:04:15.868 --> 00:04:17.300
-I got it, I got it.
-You all right?

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:18.434
You got it?
-Got it, yeah.

00:04:18.434 --> 00:04:20.734
-Thank you.
I got it. Thank you.

00:04:20.734 --> 00:04:22.033
Bye.
-Be well, be well.

00:04:22.033 --> 00:04:24.968
Tig Notaro.
[ Laughs ]

